  "releaseNotes": "v.1.0.0-preview.94\n- Feature: Added support for .NET 11 (Release Candidate). The project templates can now create projects that target .NET 11.\n- Fix: Resolved an issue where publishing a Blazing Story app for Blazor WebAssembly failed with the .NET 11 SDK.\n- Fix: Resolved an issue where component and parameter descriptions dropped keywords written with `<see langword=\"...\"/>`, and showed references to generic types in an unreadable form instead of names such as `MySelect<TKey, TValue>`. (Issue #138, PR #139 contributed by @warnaa)\n\nTo see all the change logs, please visit the following URL.\n- https://github.com/jsakamoto/BlazingStory/blob/main/RELEASE-NOTES.txt",
